                        ],
                        "form": "furcated"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "1985e73d-fadd-4791-a4e3-48af0d64421a",
                        "entry_id": "1bd772a8-077c-32c4-aa28-399a9366b7a1",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "furcated"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d39ecb76-cd1e-3ab8-b682-883b696efeeb",
                        "entry_id": "1bd772a8-077c-32c4-aa28-399a9366b7a1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To fork or branch out."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d2d961b-a572-4810-966f-c82f30131de2",
                                "sense_id": "d39ecb76-cd1e-3ab8-b682-883b696efeeb",
                                "text": "But that which I believe yields a great deal of our turpentine, is the fir-tree or deal, which is a coniferous tree, evergreen, whose cones are of the lesser sort, having long leaves, either that whose leaves encompass and cover the branches, bearing long cones hanging downwards as she male fir-tree or pitch-tree; or that whose leaves grow from each side of the stalk, being more flat than those of yew, green on the upper side, and whitish underneath, furcated at the end, bearing cones shorter and thicker, growing erect, as the female fir-tree."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f52b83be-121d-404e-aaf3-34e197fe4522",
                                "sense_id": "d39ecb76-cd1e-3ab8-b682-883b696efeeb",
                                "text": "These ridges are prominent, about the thickness of a coarse thread, very numerous, irregular, and run into one another, but towards the bottom, always furcate or divide."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4873d5c-78b3-4065-b427-a8e1716818ee",
                                "sense_id": "d39ecb76-cd1e-3ab8-b682-883b696efeeb",
                                "text": "In Dyticus it even furcates, and with both prongs of the fork it encloses the intestine, and lower down the nervous cord"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff8d2d25-acde-4154-8a60-bcbbc5f500c6",
                                "sense_id": "d39ecb76-cd1e-3ab8-b682-883b696efeeb",
                                "text": "Descending keel of the pronotum, which divides into two furcating lamella"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "56acef0b-5de0-49b9-9427-cc9c8b5dca8c",
                        "source_entry_id": "1bd772a8-077c-32c4-aa28-399a9366b7a1",
                        "source_sense_id": "d39ecb76-cd1e-3ab8-b682-883b696efeeb",
                        "source_sense_description": "to fork or branch out",
                        "target_lang_word": "bifurquer",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bifurquer",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecb14332-1026-3869-97b5-65a38dd6d55f",
                                        "entry_id": "4bd70108-3d61-3b23-bfb2-31f4dd33ad60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se diviser en deux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62d75c40-f46a-4d98-a168-29214b23b9a8",
                                                "sense_id": "ecb14332-1026-3869-97b5-65a38dd6d55f",
                                                "text": "Aussi, quand, après une demi-heure de chemin, ils arrivèrent a un carrefour où la route bifurquait, Gabriel s'arrêta et parut réfléchir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7afa8d12-37eb-4c4a-a673-3915fbbbd1da",
                                                "sense_id": "ecb14332-1026-3869-97b5-65a38dd6d55f",
                                                "text": "Comme le chemin se bifurquait cent pas plus loin, nous nous arrêtâmes, ignorant laquelle des deux routes il nous fallait prendre; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04c635c1-3974-4388-a296-f79fd3749c4d",
                                                "sense_id": "ecb14332-1026-3869-97b5-65a38dd6d55f",
                                                "text": "Il consiste en une sorte de double tube en U, avec une branche longue unique, et une branche courte qui se bifurque en deux autres branches dont chacune est munie d'un robinet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e869420-f3a0-310f-8d73-ed8defd07bd7",
                                        "entry_id": "4bd70108-3d61-3b23-bfb2-31f4dd33ad60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Changer de chemin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f1e33ae-67b7-4679-a8be-1b1b98e6e60c",
                                                "sense_id": "1e869420-f3a0-310f-8d73-ed8defd07bd7",
                                                "text": "Son esprit s'apaisa, il avait la possibilité d'être heureux encore ... Recommencer sa vie au moment où il avait bifurqué vers l'ambition !..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f33891a1-daaa-4a5a-af30-997a95a0207c",
                                                "sense_id": "1e869420-f3a0-310f-8d73-ed8defd07bd7",
                                                "text": "Nous en profitons pour bifurquer brusquement et nous arrivons enfin en zigzaguant à nous mettre hors de la portée de notre intrus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f4589ea-6b8c-4ef2-b571-84bc1c42c273",
                                                "sense_id": "1e869420-f3a0-310f-8d73-ed8defd07bd7",
                                                "text": "Il est expédient de bifurquer à faux pour dérouter les pillards qui braconnent les tenderies dès l'aube, avant le propriétaire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee61887c-328e-42f8-9cf6-2639a32a0140",
                                                "sense_id": "1e869420-f3a0-310f-8d73-ed8defd07bd7",
                                                "text": "Il suivit la D 925 sur une vingtaine de kilomètres, puis prit au sud, traversa la forêt de Lancosme jusqu'à Méobecq et bifurqua vers Rosnay par la D 27."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1bf0dfb7-2d68-3361-aaf1-caa3b6e02665",
                                        "entry_id": "4bd70108-3d61-3b23-bfb2-31f4dd33ad60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Changer de direction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ccefff8-68e2-4edd-b387-e861fefb6cbd",
                                                "sense_id": "1bf0dfb7-2d68-3361-aaf1-caa3b6e02665",
                                                "text": "Quittant la vallée de Chuy, la route bifurque vers les Kirghiz Alaa-Tau et se faufile comme un serpent entre les pans d'une muraille déchiquetée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
